iquely satisfying driving experience. Whether you're a train enthusiast or just love the Wild West, this is your ticket to railroading adventure.", "short_description": "Western Rails puts you in the boots of a steam train engineer in the Wild West! Drive powerful locomotives, control turnouts, refill water, attach wagons, and haul cargo or passengers across a rugged desert frontier. With hands-on levers and immersive VR mechanics, experience the golden age of railroads like never before. All aboard for adventure\u2014Western Rails is your ticket to the frontier!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/2020533d-edfe-4f50-9cc0-cf108ba7688e", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Redcontroller Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://redcontrollerinteractive.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23922796194081185"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3689921231170222"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2080452992880656"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1174647574516895"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1250492099523739"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1250492099523739"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1786726800, "status": "PUBLISHE